lvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">2、全国分为三十六郡，后增至四十余郡。各郡设立郡守、郡监、郡尉</p><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><span data-flag=\"tag\" style=\"font-size:16px;padding:5px;margin:10px 0px;color:#fff;background:#FC5832;display:inline-block;\">3</span><b>北筑长城，统一法度</b></p><span><br></span><p lang=\"en\" style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#333333;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;\"><b><img data-key=\"2\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group37/M02/5F/A4/wKgJoFozwCeSbcJkAACPKTZVU9I704.jpg?op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group37/M02/5F/A4/wKgJoFozwCeSbcJkAACPKTZVU9I704.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group37/M02/5F/A4/wKgJoFozwCeSbcJkAACPKTZVU9I704.jpg?op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"487\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group37/M02/5F/A4/wKgJoFozwCeSbcJkAACPKTZVU9I704.jpg?op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"91\"><br></b></p><p lang=\"en\" style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:#999999;word-break:break-all;font-weight:normal;\" data-flag=\"backup\">秦长城遗址</p><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">1、中原的统一，促使华夏与游牧民族间的矛盾日益加深，为应对匈奴入侵，秦始皇派蒙恬北筑长城。</p><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">